   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "**Artificial Intelligence (AI)** is a branch of computer science that focuses on creating systems capable of performing tasks that typically require human intelligence. These tasks include:\n",
      "\n",
      "- **Learning** (acquiring information and improving over time)\n",
      "- **Reasoning** (making decisions based on data)\n",
      "- **Problem-solving** (finding solutions to complex issues)\n",
      "- **Perception** (understanding the world through data, like vision or speech)\n",
      "- **Language understanding** (interpreting and generating human language)\n",
      "\n",
      "### **Types of AI**\n",
      "1. **Narrow (Weak) AI** – Designed for a specific task (e.g., Siri, recommendation systems).\n",
      "2. **General (Strong) AI** – Hypothetical AI with human-like reasoning and adaptability (not yet achieved).\n",
      "3. **Superintelligent AI** – AI that surpasses human intelligence (theoretical and controversial).\n",
      "\n",
      "### **Key AI Technologies**\n",
      "- **Machine Learning (ML)** – AI that learns from data (e.g., deep learning, neural networks).\n",
      "- **Natural Language Processing (NLP)** – Enables AI to understand and generate human language.\n",
      "- **Computer Vision** – AI that interprets visual data (e.g., facial recognition, self-driving cars).\n",
      "- **Robotics** – AI-powered machines that perform physical tasks.\n",
      "\n",
      "### **Applications of AI**\n",
      "- **Healthcare** (diagnosis, drug discovery)\n",
      "- **Finance** (fraud detection, algorithmic trading)\n",
      "- **Autonomous Vehicles** (self-driving cars)\n",
      "- **Customer Service** (chatbots, virtual assistants)\n",
      "- **Entertainment** (recommendation systems, AI-generated art)\n",
      "\n",
      "### **Ethical Concerns**\n",
      "- **Bias** (AI can inherit human biases from training data)\n",
      "- **Privacy** (AI systems may collect and misuse personal data)\n",
      "- **Job Displacement** (automation replacing human jobs)\n",
      "- **Safety** (risks of AI systems making harmful decisions)\n",
      "\n",
      "AI is rapidly evolving, with both exciting potential and significant challenges. Would you like a deeper dive into any specific aspect?\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
